Subject: Potential Collaboration Work: using STAN for Fisheries Stock Assessment - model parsimony vs parameter estimation.
Message-ID: <-fjdcrAW-nE.Ktfbhi1qk44J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/-fjdcrAW-nE/m/Ktfbhi1qk44J>
