I'm looking for a way to sum the rows of a matrix in STAN.

For example in JAGS this command is valid:

for(i in 1:I){
   for (j in 1:J){
       X[i]<- sum(Y[i,j]);
   }
}

What would be the equivalent in STAN?

Many thanks,

Allan

