References: <XBE-6R8PfaI.AVz8Wh6uPboJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <XBE-6R8PfaI.SkqxFaxe8dgJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/XBE-6R8PfaI/m/BuOP2JB8P-IJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
