> Second, I am curious as to how I can interpret the coefficients from the output of my original code (repeated below).
>
>         mean se_mean   sd   2.5%    25%    50%    75%  97.5% n_eff Rhat
> b[1,1]   8.81    0.09 3.45   1.99   6.52   8.84  11.09  15.57  1545    1
> b[1,2]  -1.82    0.09 3.52  -8.78  -4.17  -1.84   0.55   5.26  1718    1
> b[2,1]  -9.32    0.09 3.43 -16.09 -11.55  -9.27  -6.97  -2.85  1495    1
