On Tuesday, February 17, 2015 at 1:24:02 PM UTC-5, Jiqiang Guo wrote:
> Why not just passing a seed from R, from which the RNG can be initialized?

That's what my suggestion does, it just gives you a handle on the R side to the resulting RNG so that you don't
have to make a new one for every function and you can see the result of making multiple calls with the same
RNG to your function.

Krzysztof

