Let me see if I have the logic right: The usual way Stan does stuff in C++ is to template on RNG and the function signatures take a RNG&. When getting rid of all the templating, I changed those signatures to a RNG* because that is what I thought would be passed from R, and then in the function bodies I dereferenced that pointer. But I either confused Rcpp or myself in doing so.

