Hi,

I am trying to fit following state-space model

l[t]<-l[t-1] +b[t-1]+Normal(0,sigma_level)

b[t]<-b[t-1]+ +Normal(0,sigma_trend)

y[t]<-l[t-1]+b[t-1]+Student(nu,0,sigma)

