Subject: Re: [stan-users] advice about a model with mean dependent variance
Message-ID: <PFuyzpQiXyg.EG8uOzsTUBYJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <PFuyzpQiXyg.NqLJWDP5hxYJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
