Subject: Re: [stan-users] sparse data matrix, making X*b go fast
Message-ID: <mtF3udlP3PM.F7agCnzygwcJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <mtF3udlP3PM.BoFR2gSdbtgJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <mtF3udlP3PM.yT02mN6LYW8J@stan-users.groups.google.com> <mtF3udlP3PM.BoFR2gSdbtgJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
