If the neg_binomial_2_cdf() function is not stable enough, you could do 9 component mixtures of the negative binomial PMF. Observing a count_cat of 1-9 just tells you that it is 1 or 2 or 3 or ... or 9. For 20+, I guess you could use the neg_binomial_2_ccdf() function if it exists or 1 minus the sum of 20 PMFs.

