You definitely defined it properly if this is the model you're using.

Like Daniel, I don't see how the model you include

> parameters {
> ...
>  vector<lower=0>[nB] sigma_beta;
>  real<lower=0> sigma_eq;

> model{
>   sigma_eq ~ cauchy(0,2);
