[changed subject to avoid hijacking the thread]

Sorry --- I meant adapt_delta.  Though I actually
called stan() with adapt_gamma to produce the results
I showed before.   I'll post back in that thread with
results.

All I know is that adapt_gamma is one of the Nesterov optimization
parameters --- we use that algorithm for adaptation.  You'd
need to read the cited paper.  If you figure it out and let me
know, I'll drop it in the doc.

Matt wrote the orginal code, but Michael re-implemented/ported
it, so maybe he knows.

- Bob

