From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Thu, 26 Feb 2015 03:22:18 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] rstan - how to use/re-use a stanfit object for different prediction
Message-ID: <tB40xNXP26g.f5kb7c4HCUIJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <tB40xNXP26g.A42w8c9pqBUJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
